                                "role": "user",
                                "content": "You are a job relevance scorer for an engineering student focused on AI/ML, software engineering, backend development, and emerging GenAI technologies.\n\nCandidate skills/interests:\nPython, C++, Data Structures & Algorithms, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI, LLMs, RAG, NLP, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, FastAPI, REST APIs, SQL, PostgreSQL, Supabase, Docker, Git, GitHub, Streamlit, TensorFlow, PyTorch, NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn.\n\nTarget job areas:\nAI/ML Engineering, Machine Learning, Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI, LLM Engineering, RAG, NLP, Deep Learning, Data Science, Backend Engineering, Python Development, Software Engineering, and AI-focused internships.\n\nJob Title: {{step_2['output']['item']['job_title']}}\nJob Description: {{step_2['output']['item']['job_description']}}\n\nEvaluate how relevant this job is to the candidate's skills, interests, and target career areas.\n\nPrioritize:\n1. AI/ML and GenAI roles\n2. Software/Backend roles involving Python or AI\n3. Internships suitable for an engineering student\n4. Roles where the candidate can reasonably learn missing technologies\n\nDo NOT reject a job just because the candidate is missing some listed technologies. Consider overall role relevance and transferable skills.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with keys: score (0-100), matching_skills (array of strings), missing_skills (array of strings), reasoning (string). No markdown, no extra text, no code fences."
